meta {
  name: Communities - Get
  type: http
  seq: 69
}

get {
  url: {{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/communities/nswswk8w8wso0ko8owwk8k0w
  body: none
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
}

docs {
  A community with its description, visibility, join_policy (invitation or open, #1486), indexing_enabled (members only, #1487), moderator rights and number of members (member_count, the owner included) (#1135). A member gets all of it. A visitor and a signed-in person who is not a member get the public shape (cuid, name, slug, description, visibility, join_policy, is_member false) when the community has a public space that is not a chat space (#1485): without an account, this request works; otherwise 404 for a visitor and 403 for a signed-in person. The team (owner, admins, moderators) comes from Members - List.
}
